flowchart LR
  title: 数据处理流水线
  src1[业务数据库] --> cdc[CDC 采集]
  src2[日志文件] --> flume[Flume]
  cdc --> kafka[(Kafka)]
  flume --> kafka
  kafka --> flink[Flink 实时计算]
  kafka --> spark[Spark 离线计算]
  flink --> ch[(ClickHouse)]
  spark --> hive[(Hive 数仓)]
  hive --> bi[BI 报表]
  ch --> bi
  ch --> alert{告警?}
  alert -->|是| notify[通知服务]
  alert -->|否| bi
